{"type":"message","id":"1e050baf","parentId":"e511da1e","timestamp":"2026-05-09T04:54:40.673Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Run this locally (it generates a **temporary** 3072-bit RSA keypair in a temp dir and prints the paths):\n\n```sh\ntmpdir=\"$(mktemp -d)\"\nssh-keygen -t rsa -b 3072 -N \"\" -f \"$tmpdir/temp_rsa\" -C \"temp-$(date -u +%Y%m%dT%H%M%SZ)\"\necho \"Private key: $tmpdir/temp_rsa\"\necho \"Public key : $tmpdir/temp_rsa.pub\"\n```\n\nTo display the public key:\n\n```sh\ncat \"$tmpdir/temp_rsa.pub\"\n```"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"Idealab","model":"gpt-5.2-1211-global","usage":{"input":11330,"output":132,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11462,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778302473217}}
